   },
   {
    "suite": "experience_fix",
    "ok": true,
    "answer": "把命令拆成列表传给 `subprocess.run`（或 `Popen`），不要把路径拼成字符串，例如：\n\n```python\nsubprocess.run([r\"C:\\Program Files\\MyApp\\app.exe\", \"--arg\"])\n```\n\n这样空格会被正确处理。",
